// The notebook view: every org file as a tree on the left, the one you pick
// shown on the right, and a panel that slides in over the page holding the
// links into and out of it - the list of them on top, the graph of them
// underneath.
//
// The buttons over the page pick what "shown" means. Rendered is the html
// exporter's page in a frame. Org is the file's own text, coloured here by
// components/OrgSource.tsx. Sheet is only offered for the org files the server
// reads as D&D characters, and is the page `orgs dnd sheet -format html`
// writes, fetched as a string rather than written to a file.
//
// The tree is built here rather than asked for, because /files already hands
// over every path the server tracks and the shape of the tree is just those
// paths split up. /links/stats decorates it with how many links each file is on
// either end of.

